ery</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Blake Gilks</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Van de Rijn</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Software Tools for High-Throughput Analysis and Archiving of Immunohistochemistry Staining Data Obtained with Tissue Microarrays</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>2002</year><volume>161</volume><fpage>1557</fpage><lpage>1565</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12414504</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morgan</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobuzio-Donahue</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Razzaque</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Faith</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>De Marzo</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TMAJ: Open source software to manage a tissue microarray database [abstract]</article-title><source>Arch Pathol Lab Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>128</volume><fpage>1094</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Demichelis</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Sboner</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbareschi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dell' Anna</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TMABoost: an integrated system for comprehensive management of Tissue Microarray data</article-title><source>IEEE Trans Inf Technol Biomed</source><year>2006</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>19</fpage><lpage>27</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16445246</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1109/TITB.2005.855540</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-